## The knight falls back

@hollow{os}: Little wishes. Little lights. You think you can take back what I have eaten?
@aria{emotion="sad"}: That voice. That's him. That's the one who took the winter.
<branch id="c1s8Answer" prompt="The voice is waiting for you to answer.">
  <choice id="defy" label="Every star, one by one.">
    @hollow{os emotion="smug"}: Then I will eat them twice.
  </choice>
  <choice id="silent" label="Say nothing. Draw your sword.">
    @hollow{os}: Silence. Good. The quiet ones taste sweeter.
  </choice>
</branch>
@lumi{emotion="sad"}: I hate him so much. I'm a star. I'm not built for hating. But I'm managing.
